kwallet-pam (5.17.5-1) experimental; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.

  [ Maximiliano Curia ]
  * New upstream release (5.16.5).
  * Salsa CI automatic initialization by Tuco
  * Update build-deps and deps with the info from cmake

  [ Pino Toscano ]
  * New upstream release.
  * Bump the debhelper compatibility to 12:
    - switch the debhelper build dependency to debhelper-compat 12
    - remove debian/compat
  * Upstream dropped support for KDE 4, so:
    - drop the libpam-kwallet4 binary
    - stop doing the qt4 build
  * Relax libpam-kwallet-common dependency in libpam-kwallet5, otherwise it
    will not be installable in case of binNMUs.
  * Use https for Format in copyright.
  * Switch cmake parameter LIBEXEC_INSTALL_DIR to KDE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR,
    as the former is deprecated.
  * Bump Standards-Version to 4.4.1, no changes required.

